        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Band: 10cc\n- Albums: The Original Soundtrack\n- Songs: “Life Is a Minestrone”, “I’m Not in Love”\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman were members of the band 10cc.\n- In 1975, 10cc released the album The Original Soundtrack.\n- “I’m Not in Love” was a single from 10cc’s 1975 album The Original Soundtrack.\n- “Life Is a Minestrone” was the other single from 10cc’s 1975 album The Original Soundtrack besides “I’m Not in Love”.",
